    "baseRefName": "experiment/shepherd-control",
    "body": "Extends the math tool with factorial calculations while preserving the existing Fibonacci contract. CLI execution now dispatches between validated `fibonacci` and `factorial` operations.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added pure, numeric-only `Get-Factorial` support for non-negative integers.\n- Added validated operation selection, defaulting to Fibonacci for compatibility.\n- Preserved exact single-line output:\n  ```powershell\n  ./math-tool.ps1 -N 5 -Operation factorial\n  # Factorial(5) = 120\n  ```\n- Added coverage for factorial edge cases, output purity, operation discrimination, isolated CLI execution, unsupported operations, and Fibonacci regression.\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n- Fixes #3",
